# One line-ending rule for the whole repo: LF in the repo and in checkouts (the game and the tools read LF fine on Windows)
* text=auto eol=lf

# Generated assets: text DirectX .X files are written by tools/blender/*.py and are never merged by hand. Diffs of them are noise, so collapse them in
# pull requests and let a conflict take the regenerated version.
*.X linguist-generated=true -diff merge=binary
*.x linguist-generated=true -diff merge=binary

# Real binaries
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.ogg binary
